{"name":"Lunatic Sky Dancer","hex":"#76fda8","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"lunatic","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An insane person."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Crazed, mad, insane, demented.","Relating to the Moon; lunar."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/lunatic"},{"term":"sky","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-3 language code for Sikaiana."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The atmosphere above a given point, especially as visible from the surface of the Earth as the place where the sun, moon, stars, and clouds are seen.","With a descriptive word: the part of the sky which can be seen from a specific place or at a specific time; its climate, condition, etc."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sky"},{"term":"dancer","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person who dances, usually as a hobby, an occupation, or a profession.","A stripper."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dancer"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sky Dancers","blocks":[{"text":"Sky Dancers are a line of toys manufactured by Galoob which were popular in the mid-1990s and were the basis for an animated series. The toys consisted of a pullstring base and a doll with foam wings. When the doll was inserted into the base and the string was pulled, it would launch into the air and spin its wings like a propeller as it flew, similar to a helicopter."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sky_Dancers","wikidata":"Q3828812"},{"title":"Lunatic","blocks":[{"text":"Lunatic is a term referring to a person who is seen as mentally ill, dangerous, foolish, or crazy—conditions once attributed to \"lunacy\". The word derives from lunaticus meaning \"of the moon\" or \"moonstruck\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/What_a_Man_may_have_been%2C_%26_yet_not_lose_the_Vote.jpg/330px-What_a_Man_may_have_been%2C_%26_yet_not_lose_the_Vote.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org